<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Jan y/y inflation revised down to 1.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Jan y/y inflation revised down to 1.8 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIENNA, March 7, Reuter - The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	    Jan. 97	Dec. 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise     0.0 (0.1)	 0.0</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	   1.8 (1.9)	 2.3</p>
<p> Index			  100.7 (131.4)   131.3</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data for January are based on a new consumer price index, which takes 1996 as the base year. Data in brackets and data for December 1996 are based on 1986=100. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
